WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.500
Ten tabs open just to run your morning? The Classroom Dashboard puts your whole class day on one screen.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.750
Pick a ready-made layout. The board fills in.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:11.200
Kids check in from their own screens.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.150
Start a timer. Count down to the field trip.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.850
Points for kindness and teamwork.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.300
A QR code for any site. A hall pass in one tap.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.750
Switch to Math: fractions kids can see.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.200
Jump along the number line.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.850
Geoboards, number rods and lots more.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:36.300
Push it to every student's screen.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.550
Need their attention? Eyes up.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:47.200
Make it yours: add, drag, pick a background.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.050
Oomba Academy Classroom Dashboard. Your whole class day, on one screen. oomba.ai

